---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../site.config';
const { email } = SITE.advertising;
---
<Page
  title="Thanks for your enquiry"
  description="Your media kit request has reached The Learning Curve."
  standfirst="Thanks. We'll reply with the media kit: audience figures, rates, packages and our founding partner offer."
  noindex
>
  <p>If it hasn't arrived in a couple of working days, write to <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>.</p>
  <p>In the meantime, our <a href="/advertising/#policy-h">advertising and sponsorship policy</a> sets out what sponsors can and can't buy.</p>
</Page>
